@rainronin/dsh-balance-monitor README · Usage：**Sidebar badge** — at the sidebar footer next to Settings: `刷新` force-refreshes
past the cache; polling follows the host-configured interval (30s by default);
the collapsed (rail) state shows a single status lamp (green = `连接正常`,
amber = degraded). The badge follows the dsh native theme. When a conversation is
selected, the badge also shows `本会话 ¥xx.xx` — the estimated cumulative cost of
that conversation, calculated from official DeepSeek V4 peak/off-peak pricing;
switching conversations switches the cost automatically.
